		<h1>About Us</h1>
		<p>
			Line International Project LLC, established on 24-09-2008, is a trusted provider of comprehensive building solutions, delivering quality workmanship and reliable services across every stage of construction and maintenance. Our expertise includes building construction, pest control services, waterproofing solutions, gypsum decoration, painting, and complete building maintenance.
		</p>

